WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.417 --> 00:00:03.792
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You're an interesting man, Scott Lang.

00:00:04.959 --> 00:00:05.876
You're an Avenger...

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:10.209
...you have a daughter...

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.417
...but you've lost a lot of time, like me.

00:00:16.876 --> 00:00:17.792
SCOTT LANG
Who are you?

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:20.250
KANG THE CONQUEROR
I'm the man who can give you

00:00:20.292 --> 00:00:21.209
more time.

00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:25.042
JANET VAN DYNE
Scott, you cannot trust him!

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:26.334
YOUNG CASSIE LANG
Daddy!

00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:27.876
SCOTT LANG
I just lost so much.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.334
He can give us a second chance.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:34.125
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You will bring me what I need...

00:00:34.792 --> 00:00:36.834
...or everything you call a life...

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:38.250
...will end.

00:00:40.751 --> 00:00:42.459
You may not want her
to watch this.

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:43.792
SCOTT LANG
We had a deal.

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:48.375
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You thought you could win?

00:00:49.209 --> 00:00:50.250
SCOTT LANG
I don't have to win...

00:00:50.918 --> 00:00:52.584
...we both just have to lose.

00:00:53.792 --> 00:00:54.375
CASSIE LANG
Dad!

00:00:54.417 --> 00:00:55.375
SCOTT LANG
I'm sorry Cassie!

00:00:55.417 --> 00:00:56.542
[Screaming]

